<wpt lat="49.304960" lon="-1.192860"><name>Normandy Victory Museum (Normandy)</name><desc>Extra stop

Hedgerow fighting and the daily life of soldiers and civilians — the world Easy lived in from 13 to 28 June.

Strong on the bocage battle that followed Carentan.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

