<wpt lat="49.175310" lon="-0.441300"><name>D-Day Wings Museum (Normandy)</name><desc>Extra stop

Aviation context — the aircraft and crews that carried the airborne divisions and covered the beaches.

Best before the Caen Memorial on the last day.

Accuracy: Documented site.

