<wpt lat="49.479920" lon="-1.296720"><name>Crisbecq (Marcouf) Battery (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 1

Heavy 210 mm naval battery that dueled with the fleet off Utah and was not taken until 12 June. Shows the scale of gun the Brécourt battery was a small cousin of.

Casemates and museum north of Utah Beach.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

