<wpt lat="49.461000" lon="-1.306000"><name>Azeville Battery (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 1

Four casemates linked by tunnels, painted to look like houses; fired on Utah and held out until 9 June.

Walkable tunnels; pair with Crisbecq.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

