<wpt lat="49.337300" lon="-0.460000"><name>Juno Beach Centre — Courseulles (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 4

The Canadians took the heaviest losses of the British beaches in the first hour, then advanced further inland than any other force on D-Day.

Canada's museum on the beach; German bunkers in the dunes.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

