<wpt lat="49.303730" lon="-0.450570"><name>Bény-sur-Mer Canadian Cemetery (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 4

2,048 Canadian graves from Juno and the fighting for Caen.

Quiet, rarely crowded.

Accuracy: Documented site.

