<wpt lat="49.265280" lon="-0.310030"><name>Hillman fortress — Colleville-Montgomery (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 5

The German regimental HQ bunker complex that held up the Suffolks for most of D-Day and helped stop Sword's advance on Caen.

Restored bunkers; open on set days.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

