<wpt lat="49.285700" lon="-0.255300"><name>Sword Beach — Ouistreham (Normandy)</name><desc>Tour day 5

Lord Lovat's commandos landed here with a piper playing and marched to relieve Pegasus Bridge by early afternoon. The Grand Bunker — the German fire-control tower — is now a museum.

Grand Bunker museum and the Kieffer commando memorial.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/normandy.html

