<wpt lat="51.586940" lon="5.492900"><name>Koevering (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 1

The last cut of Hell's Highway, 24–25 September, on the straight road between Sint-Oedenrode and Veghel. Burnt-out convoys lined the road here while Arnhem fell.

Drive it slowly; the road is the exhibit.

Accuracy: MEDIUM — close to the spot.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

DZ Charlie field guides · dzcharlie.com</desc><link href="https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html"><text>Open the guide</text></link><sym>Flag, Blue</sym><type>Holland &amp; Bastogne · Tour stops</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="51.769250" lon="5.736650"><name>Grave bridge (John S. Thompson bridge) (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

The Maas bridge taken intact by the 504th within minutes of landing on 17 September — the first Market Garden bridge secured.

The 82nd's textbook success, in contrast to Son.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

