<wpt lat="51.851100" lon="5.871700"><name>Nijmegen — Waal crossing &amp; road bridge (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

On 20 September the 504th crossed the Waal in canvas boats under fire while the Guards' tanks rushed the road bridge. Half the boats were lost; the bridge fell at 19:00. The Waal crossing memorial stands on the south bank.

The width of the river is the story.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

