<wpt lat="51.785650" lon="5.937010"><name>Freedom Museum, Groesbeek (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

The whole Market Garden and Rhineland story, on the 82nd's landing ground above Nijmegen.

Use the corridor map to place Easy's road inside the plan.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

