<wpt lat="51.961170" lon="5.813890"><name>Driel — Polish brigade memorial (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

Where Sosabowski's Poles landed on 21 September and tried to reach the trapped British across the river. The Island begins here.

Look north across the Rhine to Oosterbeek.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

