<wpt lat="51.977500" lon="5.911500"><name>John Frost Bridge, Arnhem (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

A bridge too far: Frost's 700 men held the north end for four days and were overrun on 21 September. The rebuilt bridge carries his name.

Stand at the north end; the houses the paras held were on this side.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

