<wpt lat="51.987750" lon="5.832670"><name>Airborne Museum Hartenstein, Oosterbeek (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

Urquhart's headquarters hotel, now the museum of the Arnhem battle: nine days in the perimeter, then Operation Berlin's night evacuation.

The evacuation route ran south from here to the river — the same river Easy watched from the other side a month later.

Accuracy: Documented site.

