<wpt lat="51.993600" lon="5.848420"><name>Airborne War Cemetery, Oosterbeek (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 2

1,700 graves, mostly of the 1st Airborne Division. Local schoolchildren lay flowers here every September.

End the day here.

Accuracy: Documented site.

