<wpt lat="50.008500" lon="5.738500"><name>Bastogne War Museum &amp; Mardasson Memorial (Holland &amp; Bastogne)</name><desc>Tour day 3

The best single museum of the Bulge, beside the star-shaped American memorial. Do it first: it gives the siege its shape before you go into the woods.

Walk up to the Mardasson after the museum and look north-east — the Bois Jacques is the dark line on the skyline.

Accuracy: Documented site.

