<wpt lat="48.269800" lon="11.468300"><name>Dachau Concentration Camp Memorial (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 2

The first camp and the model for all the others; the Kaufering camps were its sub-camps. Liberated by the 42nd and 45th Divisions the same weekend Easy was at Landsberg.

Allow the full time. Free; audio guide recommended.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

