<wpt lat="48.146600" lon="11.568000"><name>Munich Documentation Centre for the History of National Socialism (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 3

On the site of the Brown House, the party's headquarters: how Munich made the movement, and what the city did with it. Context for everything on the Obersalzberg.

Königsplatz outside was the parade ground.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

DZ Charlie field guides · dzcharlie.com</desc><link href="https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html"><text>Open the guide</text></link><sym>Flag, Blue</sym><type>Germany &amp; Austria · Tour stops</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="47.631300" lon="13.041800"><name>Dokumentation Obersalzberg (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 3

The museum on Hitler's mountain: the Obersalzberg as the second seat of government, the bunker system underneath, and the American arrival of May 1945. Rebuilt and reopened in 2023.

Go down into the bunkers — the 506th men did.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

