<wpt lat="51.560000" lon="13.005000"><name>Torgau — Elbe Day (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 1

Where American and Soviet troops met and cut Germany in two.

Memorial on the river; 4 h east of the route.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

