<wpt lat="52.512700" lon="13.381100"><name>Berlin — Reichstag and the Führerbunker site (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 1

The end of Hitler and of the Reich; the bunker site is a car park with an information board.

Far off the route; the Topography of Terror is nearby.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

