<wpt lat="49.433500" lon="11.110800"><name>Nuremberg — Documentation Centre &amp; Zeppelinfeld (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Tour day 2

The party's parade ground and the courtroom of the 1945–46 trials.

On the road south.

Accuracy: Documented site.

