<wpt lat="50.939400" lon="6.952000"><name>NS Documentation Centre (EL-DE Haus) (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Cologne

Gestapo prison and the story of Cologne under the Nazis; ten minutes from the cathedral.

Allow: 1 hr

