<wpt lat="47.637970" lon="13.018000"><name>Salzbergwerk Berchtesgaden (Germany &amp; Austria)</name><desc>Berchtesgaden

The salt mine 506th men toured as tourists in May 1945. (Göring's looted art was found in Obersalzberg shelters, trains and caches — the famous salt-mine repository was Altaussee in Austria, not here.)

Allow: 1.5 hr

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/germany-austria.html

